&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Staff Engineer at Nozomi Networks, you will operate at both a technical leadership and hands-on engineering level, driving complex initiatives across teams while setting a high bar for engineering excellence.&amp;nbsp;You will own critical areas of the system, influence architectural decisions, and mentor engineers, while delivering impactful&amp;nbsp;features and platform improvements at scale.&lt;br&gt;The final job title (e.g., Software Engineer, Senior, or Staff) will be aligned to the successful candidate&#39;s demonstrated level of knowledge, skills, and impact, rather than years of experience.&lt;/p&gt;
